msgid "Type to filter; press Tab to move to the list. Use ↑/↓ and Enter to inspect an action. Ctrl+O opens it; Esc clears the filter or goes back. In chat, type / for quick commands."
msgstr "输入以筛选；按 Tab 移到列表。用 ↑/↓ 和 Enter 查看操作。Ctrl+O 打开；Esc 清除筛选或返回。在聊天中输入 / 使用快捷命令。"

