msgstr "允许建议的文件编辑"

msgid "This grants reads/searches and optionally edits for this exact folder. Every edit asks until you explicitly enable automatic edits. Commands and other projects receive no new access."
msgstr "这会授予对此确切文件夹的读取/搜索，以及可选的编辑。在你明确启用自动编辑之前，每次编辑都会询问。命令和其他项目不会获得新的访问。"

