msgid "Danger: allow automatic file edits"
msgstr "危险：允许自动文件编辑"

msgid "The assistant may create or overwrite files here without showing each diff for approval. Model mistakes or malicious instructions in files can damage your work. Review changes with Git and keep backups."
msgstr "助手可能在此创建或覆盖文件，而不再逐个显示 diff 供你批准。模型错误或文件中的恶意指令可能损坏你的工作。请用 Git 审查更改并保留备份。"

msgid "This setting persists for this workspace. Disable it from Files → Folders. Authority, ISySentinel, path protections and journaling stay active; they cannot guarantee that an allowed edit is correct. Commands, deletes, moves and commits still require their own approvals."
msgstr "此设置会保留在本工作区。可在 文件 → 文件夹 中关闭。Authority、ISySentinel、路径保护和日志仍然有效；它们不能保证已允许的编辑是正确的。命令、删除、移动和提交仍需要各自的批准。"

msgid "Enable automatic edits"
msgstr "启用自动编辑"

msgid "Alias, e.g. other-project"
msgstr "别名，例如 other-project"

