msgid "ISyCode will stop listing, reading, and searching files in this workspace. Your files and conversations stay where they are."
msgstr "ISyCode 将停止在此工作区列出、读取和搜索文件。你的文件和对话仍留在原处。"

msgid "ISyCode can list folders, read text files, find file names, and use a chosen AGENTS.md to understand your project. It cannot edit or delete files, run commands, or access folders outside this workspace. You will still be asked before sensitive actions."
msgstr "ISyCode 可以列出文件夹、读取文本文件、查找文件名，并使用你选择的 AGENTS.md 来理解项目。它不能编辑或删除文件、运行命令，也不能访问此工作区以外的文件夹。敏感操作前仍会询问你。"

msgid "Set up this workspace?"
msgstr "要设置此工作区吗？"

msgid "Launch directory:\n{path}\n\n{warning}If this is a recurring project, Yes creates an empty .isyroot here and saves chat sessions in your private ISyCode state directory. .isyroot identifies the workspace; it does not grant filesystem access. Not now keeps this run temporary, and its chat history is removed when ISyCode exits."
msgstr "启动目录：\n{path}\n\n{warning}如果这是常用项目，选「是」会在此创建空的 .isyroot，并把聊天会话保存在你的私有 ISyCode 状态目录。.isyroot 标识工作区；它不授予文件系统访问。选「现在不要」则本次运行为临时，退出 ISyCode 时聊天记录会被删除。"

msgid "Use recurring mode for new folders?"
msgstr "新文件夹使用常用模式？"

msgid "When ISyCode first opens a folder without a saved choice, it will create an empty .isyroot marker there. This remembers the workspace identity only; it does not grant file access or copy permissions from another workspace. Broad folders such as your home directory, its parents, the temporary directory, or a mount point still ask first, so unrelated projects never share one workspace by accident."
msgstr "当 ISyCode 第一次打开尚未保存选择的文件夹时，会在那里创建一个空的 .isyroot 标记。这只记住工作区身份；不会授予文件访问，也不会从另一个工作区复制权限。主目录、其上级、临时目录或挂载点等宽泛文件夹仍会先询问，以免不相关的项目意外共享同一个工作区。"

msgid "Welcome to ISyCode · how do you want to start?"
msgstr "欢迎使用 ISyCode · 你想如何开始？"

msgid "{root}\n\n{provider_line}\n\nQuick Start: this folder becomes a recurring workspace in Classic mode — read/search, edit proposals and chat are ready. One more confirmation can turn on all coding tools, and edits, commands and commits still ask until you approve them.\nCustom setup: choose recurrence, Classic or Security, and each tool step by step.\n\nBoth paths keep IsySentinel and the action journal on everything."
msgstr "{root}\n\n{provider_line}\n\n快速开始：此文件夹成为 Classic 模式下的常用工作区 — 读/搜、编辑提议和聊天已就绪。再确认一次即可开启全部编码工具；编辑、命令和提交在你批准之前仍会询问。\n自定义设置：逐步选择是否常用、Classic 或 Security，以及每一项工具。\n\n两条路径都对所有操作保留 IsySentinel 和操作日志。"

msgid "How should ISyCode work in this folder?"
msgstr "ISyCode 应如何在此文件夹中工作？"

msgid "{root}\n\nClassic: ready to code. Read/search, edit proposals, chat, saved sessions, Git review and sandboxed commands (when available) are ready. A separate confirmation can trust this folder so ordinary edits and isolated tests stop asking one by one. Until you confirm that, each edit, delete/move, command and commit still asks. Commits, secrets and authority changes keep asking either way.\nSecurity: nothing is allowed until you turn it on in Settings → Authority.\n\nBoth modes use IsySentinel and the action journal. Free shell and sensitive files are never implied. Switch any time in Settings → Authority."
msgstr "{root}\n\nClassic：可以开始写代码。读/搜、编辑提议、聊天、已保存会话、Git 审查以及沙箱命令（如可用）均已就绪。另一次确认可以信任此文件夹，使普通编辑和隔离测试不再逐项询问。在你确认之前，每次编辑、删除/移动、命令和提交仍会询问。提交、密钥和授权更改无论哪种模式都会询问。\nSecurity：在 设置 → Authority 中开启之前，不允许任何操作。\n\n两种模式都使用 IsySentinel 和操作日志。绝不隐含自由 shell 或敏感文件。可随时在 设置 → Authority 中切换。"

